          'Each node has at most one outgoing edge. Return the length of the longest cycle, or −1.', 'With one outgoing edge per node, each walk either ends or enters a cycle exactly once. Stamp nodes with the walk number and the step; meeting a node stamped in the same walk gives the cycle length as the step difference.',
